oject adds another jewel to the crown of the group's achievements. Strategically positioned amidst the vibrant hub of Malad West, Kamla Jainson enjoys easy accessibility from both S.V. Road and Link Road, as well as the Malad railway station. The project is enveloped by renowned shopping destinations and state-of-the-art medical facilities. Its prime location ensures proximity to esteemed educational institutions, hospitals, ATMs, and markets, all complemented by a well-connected network of public transportation options in close proximity.\n\nConfiguration\n\n1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK\n\nReady to move\n\nCompleted in Dec 2023\n\nAvg. Price\n\n₹23,990/sq.ft\n\nRERA Carpet Area\n\n421 - 883 sqft\n\nWhy consider buying this property?\n\n* Convenient access to significant landmarks\n* Easy accessibility through S.V. Road, Link Road, and Malad railway station\n* Enhanced lifestyle with landscaped gardens, tree plantation, and children's play area\n\n* Prestigious location nestled in the heart of Malad West\n* Enveloped by renowned shopping malls and advanced medical facilities\n* Close proximity to schools, hospitals, educational institutes, restaurants, banks, and a movie theatre\n\n## Amenities\n\n![amenities/cctv-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/cctv-secondary.svg)\n\nCCTV / Video Surveillance\n\n![amenities/jogging-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/jogging-secondary.svg)\n\nJogging / Cycle Track\n\n![amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/kids-play-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nKids Play Areas / Sand Pits\n\n![amenities/large-green-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/large-green-area-secondary.svg)\n\nLarge Green Area\n\n![amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/Senior-Citizen-Sitout-secondary.svg)\n\nSenior citizen Area\n\n![amenities/walking-area-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/walking-area-secondary.svg)\n\nWalking Area\n\n![amenities/yoga-areas-secondary](/assets/icons/amenities/yoga-areas-secondary.svg)\n\nYoga Area