ount : ₹1,26,65,113\n\n## Enquire Now\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\nLet us reach out to you at the earliest.\n\n![user-primary](/assets/icons/user-primary.svg)\n\n![smartphone-primary](/assets/icons/smartphone-primary.svg)+91![arrow-down-primary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-primary.svg)\n\nREQUEST A CALLBACK\n\nI am happy to be contacted by Blox\n\n## RERA QR Codes\n\nKamla Jainsonis a real estate project registered under MahaRERA (Maharashtra Real Estate Regulatory Authority), ensuring transparency and accountability in its development.\n\nScan this RERA QR code to find out more or search ID here - <https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in>\n\n![]()[P51800014629](https://maharera.maharashtra.gov.in/projects-search-result?certificate_no=P51800014629)\n\nKamla Jainson\n\n## Frequently Asked Questions\n\n### When is the possession date for Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nPossession date of Kamla Jainson is 30 Dec 2022\n\n### What is the RERA carpet area range of Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe RERA carpet area range for Kamla Jainson is 421 - 883 sqft\n\n### What is the price range of Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe price range of Kamla Jainson is ₹1.01 Cr - 2.12 Cr\n\n### Where is Kamla Jainson located?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nKamla Jainson is located at Kamla Jainson, Haji Zakeria Road, Mamledarwadi, Malad West, Mumbai, Maharashtra 400064.\n\n### What configurations are available in Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nKamla Jainson has 1 BHK, 2 BHK, 3 BHK configurations.\n\n### What is the status of Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe status of Kamla Jainson is Ready to move.\n\n### Which amenities are provided in Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe amenities are CCTV / Video Surveillance, Jogging / Cycle Track, Kids Play Areas / Sand Pits, Large Green Area, Senior citizen Area, Walking Area, Yoga Area.\n\n### Who is the developer of Kamla Jainson?\n\n![arrow-down-secondary](/assets/icons/arrow-down-secondary.svg)\n\nThe developer of Kamla Jainson is Kamla Group.\n\n## About The Developer\n\n![Developer for Kamla Jainson:Kamla Group](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/260422013913-kamla.png)\n\n## Kamla Group\n\nKamla Group has emerged as a significant player with a distinctive focus on executing redevelopment projects, establishing itself in both residential and commercial segments across Mumbai. Over the past three decades, the company has gained expertise and acumen in conceptualizing and developing projects throughout the city. With a commitment to providing luxury residences in strategic locations, Kamla Group is known for its ability to identify opportunities, undertake medium to large-scale projects, maintain quality at every phase, and ensure timely delivery—key factors driving the company's success.\n\n## Properties In The Same Area\n\n![bloxsquare](/assets/icons/bloxsquare.svg)\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/polo-infra-developers-polo-matrix-elevation-1788606318.webp)\n\n![Polo Matrix](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/031023045019-newproject-22.webp)\n\nPolo Matrix\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹1.62 Cr - 2.33 Cr\n\n2, 3 BHK\n\nBOOK A VISIT\n\n![Property-Image](https://cdn.blox.xyz/projects-2x/hs-group-downtown-liberty-one-elevation-1788604964.webp)\n\n![Downtown Liberty One](https://cdn.blox.xyz/builders/thumb/220122014710-2.png)\n\nDowntown Liberty One\n\nMalad West\n\n![heart-primary](/assets/icons/heart-primary.svg)\n\n![phone-ring-primary](/assets/icons/phone-ring-primary.webp)\n\n₹2.04 Cr\n\n2 BHK\n\nBOOK A VI