oup, a leading force in Mumbai's redevelopment landscape. Established over three decades ago, we have built a reputation for excellence, quality, and innovation in the real estate sector. Our journey is defined by our unwavering commitment to transforming urban spaces and creating landmark developments that enhance the lives of our customers.  Kamla Group specializes in executing redevelopment projects, turning aging properties into vibrant, modern spaces. With extensive experience and a solid track record, we deliver high-quality residential and commercial developments that meet contemporary standards. Our innovative approach ensures that each project is not only functional but also aesthetically pleasing, contributing to the overall betterment of the community. |\n\n![Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pata Badlo Life Badlo Offer Banner\")\n![](data:image/svg+xml;base64,)\n![Sheth Irene photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sheth Irene photo\")\n![AJMERA BOULEVARD photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"AJMERA BOULEVARD photo\")\n![Pranav Sparsh photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Pranav Sparsh photo\")\n![Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Yukti Anchorpoint Aviara photo\")\n![Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Wings Q and R with Kindergarten photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Gurukrupa Marina Enclave Wings Q and R with Kindergarten photo\")\n![Shreeji Eternity photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Shreeji Eternity photo\")\n![Abrol Signature photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Abrol Signature photo\")\n![Chandak Treesourus photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Chandak Treesourus photo\")\n![Sheth Auris Ilaria photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Sheth Auris Ilaria photo\")\n![Lotus Sky Garden photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Lotus Sky Garden photo\")\n\n## Other Projects by Kamla Homes & Infrastructure\n\n![Kamla Borivali Lucky photo](data:image/svg+xml;base64, \"Kamla Borivali Lucky photo\")\n![Kamla Emerald photo](data:ima